  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A line <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>l</mi></math> passing through origin is perpendicular to the lines</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>l</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><mover><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>l</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><mover><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>s</mi></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>s</mi></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p>If the co-ordinates of the point in the first octant on <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>l</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> at a distance of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mn>17</mn></msqrt></math> from the point of intersection of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>l</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>l</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math> are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>,&nbsp;then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>18</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is equal to ___ .</p>",
    "image": null
